    {
      "key": "Download the OPS end-to-end test data (about 190 MB): four sequencing tiles with all eleven cycles and the phenotype fields over them, from Funk et al. 2022. The preview uses it while genotype_source is empty.",
      "source": "Download the OPS end-to-end test data (about 190 MB): four sequencing tiles with all eleven cycles and the phenotype fields over them, from Funk et al. 2022. The preview uses it while genotype_source is empty.",
